analyses for clinical trials -- like the one I'm designing right now --
use stopping rules at a level alpha = 0.01, and I feel unconfortable
stopping a trial due to a glitch in the algorithm.

Again, I appreciate any advice on the issue -- besides being Bayesian,
thank you :) 

