> Dose anyone know S+ built function for skewness and kurtosis?
No, but it's very easy to program it:
> skewness <- function(x)
mean((x - mean(x))^3)/var(x)^(3/2)

> kurtosis <- function(x)
mean((x - mean(x))^4)/var(x)^2 - 3

